@app.name@ is a fork of <a href='https://www.openstego.com'>OpenStego</a> by Samir Vaidya.
Acknowledgements:
The digital watermarking code in this product is based on the code provided by Peter Meerwald. Refer to his excellent thesis on <a href='http://www.cosy.sbg.ac.at/~pmeerw/Watermarking/'>watermarking</a>: Peter Meerwald, Digital Image Watermarking in the Wavelet Transfer Domain, Master's Thesis, Department of Scientific Computing, University of Salzburg, Austria, January 2001.
